WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.317 --> 00:00:07.621
STAYED OUTSIDE INSTEAD OF TRYING

00:00:06.620 --> 00:00:10.790
TO STOP THE SUSPECT.

00:00:07.754 --> 00:00:10.207
PETERSON

00:00:10.207 --> 00:00:12.259
PETERSO

00:00:10.924 --> 00:00:15.962
PETERSON, WHO HAS JUST RESIGNED,

00:00:12.392 --> 00:00:16.696
BELIEVES HE DID A GOOD JOB ON

00:00:16.096 --> 00:00:20.467
THIS.

00:00:16.830 --> 00:00:23.236
HE IS ALSO A SHERIFF'S DEPUTY

00:00:20.600 --> 00:00:23.503
HIMSELF. IT'S GOOD TO SEE YOU,

00:00:23.370 --> 00:00:24.771
SIR.

00:00:23.637 --> 00:00:26.373
THANK YOU FOR JOINING US.

00:00:24.905 --> 00:00:30.610
THE NEW REPORTS THAT CAME OUT

00:00:26.506 --> 00:00:32.679
NOW HAVE A TOTAL OF FOUR SHERIFF

00:00:30.744 --> 00:00:33.980
DEPUTIES WHO DID NOT ENTER THAT

00:00:32.812 --> 00:00:35.382
SCHOOL BUILDING AS THE SHOOTING

00:00:34.114 --> 00:00:37.350
WAS TAKING PLACE.

00:00:35.515 --> 00:00:37.684
WHAT DO YOU KNOW ABOUT THIS

00:00:37.484 --> 00:00:39.319
TONIGHT?

00:00:37.817 --> 00:00:43.523
&gt;&gt;  I'VE HEARD RUMORS ABOUT THAT

00:00:39.452 --> 00:00:47.661
REPORT MYSELF BUT I HAVE NOTHING

00:00:43.657 --> 00:00:52.933
TO SUBSTANTIATE THAT ANY OF

00:00:47.794 --> 00:00:53.233
THOSE CLAIMS ARE FACTUAL AT THIS

00:00:53.066 --> 00:00:57.604
TIME.

00:00:53.366 --> 00:01:01.241
&gt;&gt;  PETERSON WAS APPARENTLY

00:00:57.737 --> 00:01:02.742
BEHIND A VEHICLE WITH HIS GUN

00:01:01.374 --> 00:01:03.410
DRAWN AT THE TIME THEY SHOWED UP

00:01:02.876 --> 00:01:05.245
AT THE SCENE.

00:01:03.543 --> 00:01:07.781
CAN YOU TELL US WHAT THE

00:01:05.378 --> 00:01:08.415
PROTOCOL IS WITH THAT TYPE OF

00:01:07.914 --> 00:01:14.821
ACTIVE SHOOTER SITUATION?

00:01:08.548 --> 00:01:16.823
&gt;&gt;  WELL, DEPUTY PETERSON BEING

00:01:14.955 --> 00:01:19.059
THE FIRST OFFICER ON THE SCENE,

00:01:16.957 --> 00:01:19.326
HE DID WHAT HE WAS SUPPOSED TO

00:01:19.192 --> 00:01:21.261
DO.

00:01:19.459 --> 00:01:22.195
HE CALLED IN OTHER SUPPORT,

00:01:21.394 --> 00:01:24.097
UNITS ARRIVING FOR BACKUP.

00:01:22.329 --> 00:01:27.067
BUT AT THAT POINT, HE STOPPED

00:01:24.230 --> 00:01:28.335
THERE OF WHAT HE NEEDED TO DO.

00:01:27.200 --> 00:01:29.502
AS LAW ENFORCEMENT OFFICIALS, WE

00:01:28.468 --> 00:01:33.039
KNOW THAT EVERY DAY WHEN WE GO

00:01:29.636 --> 00:01:34.341
TO WORK, THAT THERE'S A CHANCE

00:01:33.173 --> 00:01:35.375
THAT WE MAY NOT COME HOME TO OUR

00:01:34.474 --> 00:01:36.810
FAMILY MEMBERS.

00:01:35.508 --> 00:01:37.277
AND WE ACCEPT THAT

00:01:36.943 --> 00:01:39.312
RESPONSIBILITY.

00:01:37.410 --> 00:01:40.380
AND WHEN WE HEAR AN ACTIVE

00:01:39.446 --> 00:01:43.416
SHOOTER, I DON'T CARE IF IT'S

00:01:40.513 --> 00:01:44.884
WITHIN A SCHOOL, A MALL, A HOUSE

00:01:43.550 --> 00:01:46.686
OR AN OFFICE BUILDING, WHEN YOU

00:01:45.018 --> 00:01:48.121
ARE THE FIRST PERSON THERE ON

00:01:46.820 --> 00:01:49.656
SCENE, EVERY SECOND THAT YOU

00:01:48.254 --> 00:01:51.224
DELAY GOING INTO THAT BUILDING

00:01:49.789 --> 00:01:52.125
AND EVERY SINGLE GUNFIRE THAT

00:01:51.358 --> 00:01:54.361
YOU HEAR FROM INSIDE THAT

00:01:52.258 --> 00:01:55.595
BUILDING, THAT MEANS THERE'S

00:01:54.494 --> 00:01:57.564
ANOTHER INNOCENT LIFE BEING LOST

00:01:55.729 --> 00:01:58.465
AND IT'S UNACCEPTABLE NOT TO GO

00:01:57.697 --> 00:02:00.100
INSIDE THAT BUILDING.

00:01:58.598 --> 00:02:01.401
WE KNOW THAT RISK WHEN WE PUT

00:02:00.233 --> 00:02:03.703
THE UNIFORM ON EVERY DAY AND WE

00:02:01.534 --> 00:02:05.505
HAVE TO LIVE UP TO THAT OATH.

00:02:03.837 --> 00:02:05.872
&gt;&gt;  AND DO YOU KNOW OFFICER

00:02:05.639 --> 00:02:07.774
PETERSON?

00:02:06.006 --> 00:02:08.942
&gt;&gt;  NO, I DO NOT.

00:02:07.907 --> 00:02:10.043
I'VE ONLY HAD ONE CONVERSATION

00:02:09.075 --> 00:02:12.278
WITH HIM.

00:02:10.176 --> 00:02:12.712
&gt;&gt;  WHAT OCCURRED IN THAT

00:02:12.412 --> 00:02:15.315
CONVERSATION?

00:02:12.846 --> 00:02:17.183
&gt;&gt;  JUST TO BRIEF HIM ABOUT WHAT

00:02:15.448 --> 00:02:20.020
WAS ABOUT TO TRANSPIRE WITHIN

00:02:17.317 --> 00:02:20.754
THE NEXT HOUR IN TERMS OF THE

00:02:20.153 --> 00:02:22.222
ADMINISTRATIVE MOVES THAT WERE

00:02:20.887 --> 00:02:23.923
GOING TO HAPPEN, IN TERMS OF

00:02:22.355 --> 00:02:25.158
BEING SUSPENDED WITHOUT PAY AND

00:02:24.057 --> 00:02:27.193
AN INTERNAL AFFAIRS

00:02:25.291 --> 00:02:28.895
INVESTIGATION WOULD START.

00:02:27.327 --> 00:02:30.163
&gt;&gt;  THE CORAL SPRINGS POLICE ARE

00:02:29.029 --> 00:02:30.597
APPARENTLY THE ONES WHO ARE

00:02:30.296 --> 00:02:33.867
TALKING.

00:02:30.730 --> 00:02:35.301
AND THAT'S WHY WE GOT THIS NEW

00:02:35.435 --> 00:02:40.173
DEPUTIES WHO SHOWED UP AND ALSO

00:02:37.137 --> 00:02:42.742
DIDN'T ENTER THE BUILDING.

00:02:40.306 --> 00:02:44.044
WHY WOULD THE CORAL SPRINGS

00:02:42.876 --> 00:02:45.278
OFFICER EXPRESS THEIR

00:02:44.177 --> 00:02:47.213
FRUSTRATION IF THEY HAD ENTERED

00:02:45.412 --> 00:02:47.681
THE BUILDING OR IF THIS HADN'T

00:02:47.347 --> 00:02:49.082
OCCURRED?

00:02:47.814 --> 00:02:50.583
GIVEN THE FACT THAT WE HAVE 17

00:02:49.215 --> 00:02:53.386
DEAD AND WE HAVE MORE THAN A

00:02:50.717 --> 00:02:54.788
WEEK HAS TRANSPIRED, WE STILL

00:02:53.520 --> 00:02:55.889
DON'T HAVE THE CLEAR TICK TOCK

00:02:54.921 --> 00:02:58.058
ON WHAT HAPPENED?

00:02:56.022 --> 00:02:59.626
THAT SEEMS A LITTLE MUCH, DON'T

00:02:58.191 --> 00:03:00.760
YOU THINK, GIVEN THE PUBLIC

00:02:59.759 --> 00:03:01.961
OUTCRY HERE?

00:03:00.894 --> 00:03:03.396
&gt;&gt;  GIVEN THE PUBLIC OUTCRY, I

00:03:02.095 --> 00:03:05.098
CAN SAY THERE WAS A LOT OF CHAOS

00:03:03.530 --> 00:03:07.200
ON THE SCENE THAT NIGHT.

00:03:05.231 --> 00:03:08.334
I DON'T DOUBT THE ACTIONS OF

00:03:07.333 --> 00:03:09.736
SOME OF THE CORAL SPRINGS POLICE

00:03:08.468 --> 00:03:10.203
OFFICERS THAT WERE THERE THAT

00:03:09.869 --> 00:03:11.304
DAY.

00:03:10.336 --> 00:03:12.539
HOWEVER, I DON'T KNOW ENOUGH

00:03:11.438 --> 00:03:14.607
INFORMATION TO COMMENT IF THOSE

00:03:12.672 --> 00:03:16.543
ARE THE FIRST OFFICERS ON SCENE

00:03:14.741 --> 00:03:19.245
OR IF THOSE OFFICERS THAT WENT

00:03:16.676 --> 00:03:21.214
INTO THE BUILDING FIRST FROM

00:03:19.379 --> 00:03:23.149
CORAL SPRINGS CAME OUT AND SAW

00:03:21.347 --> 00:03:24.417
ADDITIONAL DEPUTIES.

00:03:23.283 --> 00:03:27.487
I DON'T HAVE ENOUGH TO COMMENT

00:03:24.551 --> 00:03:28.988
ABOUT THAT AT THIS TIME.

00:03:27.620 --> 00:03:32.025
&gt;&gt;  SHERIFF ISRAEL BASICALLY

00:03:29.122 --> 00:03:33.860
ECHOED WHAT YOU SAID, PETERSON

00:03:32.158 --> 00:03:36.129
SHOULD HAVE ENGAGED THE SHOOTER.

00:03:33.993 --> 00:03:36.396
YOU'RE THERE, SHOTS ARE RINGING

00:03:36.262 --> 00:03:38.131
OUT.

00:03:36.529 --> 00:03:38.398
YOU DON'T STAND OUTSIDE, YOU GO

00:03:38.264 --> 00:03:41.334
IN.

00:03:38.531 --> 00:03:41.801
THAT'S LIKE THE FIREFIGHTERS AT

00:03:41.468 --> 00:03:43.503
9/11.

00:03:41.935 --> 00:03:44.270
YOU GO IN THE BUILDING WHEN

00:03:43.636 --> 00:03:44.904
EVERYONE ELSE IS LEAVING.

00:03:44.404 --> 00:03:46.072
THAT'S YOUR JOB.

00:03:45.038 --> 00:03:47.807
THAT'S WHAT YOU DO.

00:03:46.206 --> 00:03:48.274
THAT'S THE DANGER OF BEING A

00:03:47.941 --> 00:03:52.746
POLICE OFFICER.

00:03:48.408 --> 00:03:55.181
BUT YOU MADE COMMENTS ABOUT THE

00:03:52.879 --> 00:03:56.216
SCHOOL BOARD IN BROWARD COUNTY

00:03:55.315 --> 00:03:56.883
AND LAY BLAME ON THEM.

00:03:56.349 --> 00:03:58.184
EXPLAIN THAT TO US.

00:03:57.016 --> 00:04:00.553
&gt;&gt;  YES, I DO.

00:03:58.318 --> 00:04:01.821
I THINK THAT'S THE ONE ENTITY IN

00:04:00.687 --> 00:04:03.389
THIS WHOLE CONVERSATION THAT HAS

00:04:01.955 --> 00:04:06.326
NOT BEEN BROUGHT UP.

00:04:03.523 --> 00:04:07.961
SOME OF THE FAULT OF PUT ON THE

00:04:06.459 --> 00:04:10.163
BROWARD COUNTY SCHOOL BOARD.

00:04:08.094 --> 00:04:12.065
FOR YEARS THEY KNOW THE SCHOOLS

00:04:10.296 --> 00:04:14.367
ARE SOFT TARGETS.

00:04:12.198 --> 00:04:16.069
THEY CLAIM THEY WANT TOUGHER

00:04:14.501 --> 00:04:19.205
SECURITY BUT DON'T WANT TO COUGH

00:04:16.202 --> 00:04:19.572
UP THE MONEY TO PAY FOR THE

00:04:19.339 --> 00:04:21.708
SECURITY.

00:04:19.706 --> 00:04:22.942
AND THEN WHEN THEY ARE FORTUNATE

00:04:21.841 --> 00:04:25.645
ENOUGH TO HAVE A SCHOOL RESOURCE

00:04:23.076 --> 00:04:27.947
DEPUTY ON SCENE, AN ARMED POLICE

00:04:25.779 --> 00:04:28.948
PRESENCE, A LOT OF THE

00:04:28.081 --> 00:04:30.950
LIBERAL-THINKING PRINCIPALS ON

00:04:29.082 --> 00:04:32.185
CAMPUS THERE DON'T WANT THE

00:04:31.084 --> 00:04:33.987
POLICE OFFICERS MAKING ARRESTS

00:04:32.318 --> 00:04:35.889
ON CAMPUS AND DON'T WANT THE

00:04:34.120 --> 00:04:37.924
DRUGS TO BE FOUND ON CAMPUS AND

00:04:36.022 --> 00:04:40.260
DON'T WANT THE WARRANTS TO BE

00:04:38.057 --> 00:04:42.428
SHOWN ON CAMPUS BECAUSE IT LOOKS

00:04:40.393 --> 00:04:44.764
LIKE BAD STATS AT THE SCHOOL.

00:04:42.562 --> 00:04:46.800
I PLACE A LOT OF THE BLAME AT

00:04:44.898 --> 00:04:47.934
THE SCHOOL BOARD WITH THAT AND

00:04:46.933 --> 00:04:49.469
SOME OF THE PROGRAMS.

00:04:48.067 --> 00:04:49.869
FOR EXAMPLE, THE PROMISE

00:04:49.602 --> 00:04:51.604
PROGRAM.

00:04:50.003 --> 00:04:53.673
NOBODY WANTS TO FILL THE JAILS

00:04:51.738 --> 00:04:55.208
WITH JUVENILES.

00:04:53.807 --> 00:04:56.576
EVERY POLICE OFFICER WILL AGREE

00:04:55.341 --> 00:04:59.946
ON THAT.

00:04:56.709 --> 00:05:00.680
THE PROMISE PROGRAM IS AN

00:05:00.079 --> 00:05:02.382
INTERVENTION PROGRAM WHERE WE

00:05:00.814 --> 00:05:04.450
STOP FILLING THE JAILS WITH KIDS

00:05:02.515 --> 00:05:06.486
AND GET THEM INTO PROGRAMS.

00:05:04.584 --> 00:05:09.689
WHEN THAT PROGRAM STARTED, WE

00:05:06.619 --> 00:05:11.624
TOOK ALL DISCRETION AWAY FROM

00:05:09.823 --> 00:05:12.959
THE LAW ENFORCEMENT OFFICERS TO

00:05:11.758 --> 00:05:13.560
AFFECT AN ARREST IF WE CHOOSE

00:05:13.092 --> 00:05:15.261
TO.

00:05:13.693 --> 00:05:17.130
THERE'S A LOT OF PARENTS OUT

00:05:15.395 --> 00:05:19.065
THERE SCREAMING FOR HELP IN

00:05:17.263 --> 00:05:20.700
TERMS OF MENTAL HEALTH SERVICES

00:05:19.199 --> 00:05:21.067
AND FAMILY INTERVENTION FOR

00:05:20.834 --> 00:05:24.070
SERVICES.

00:05:21.201 --> 00:05:25.605
&gt;&gt;  WE HAD 23 CALLS GO INTO THE

00:05:24.204 --> 00:05:28.808
BROWARD SHERIFF'S OFFICE ABOUT

00:05:25.738 --> 00:05:34.681
THIS FAMILY.

00:05:28.942 --> 00:05:36.049
SOME WERE ABOUT NIKOLAS CRUZ'S

00:05:34.814 --> 00:05:38.251
BROTHER, INCLUDING CALLS ABOUT

00:05:36.182 --> 00:05:40.286
HIS POTENTIAL FOR VIOLENCE.

00:05:38.384 --> 00:05:42.722
AGAIN, YOU'RE THE EXPERT HERE.

00:05:40.420 --> 00:05:44.424
YOU REPRESENT THE UNION HERE.

00:05:42.856 --> 00:05:45.725
BUT 23 CALLS TO ONE HOUSE AND

00:05:44.557 --> 00:05:50.296
YOU ADD THAT WITH THE FBI TIPS

00:05:45.859 --> 00:05:51.164
THEY GOT IN 2016 AND AS EARLY AS

00:05:50.430 --> 00:05:54.868
IN NOVEMBER AND APPARENTLY

00:05:51.297 --> 00:05:57.637
ANOTHER ONE IN FEBRUARY, THIS IS

00:05:57.770 --> 00:06:01.341
RED FLAG AFTER RED FLAG AFTER

00:06:00.440 --> 00:06:01.808
RED FLAG.

00:06:01.474 --> 00:06:03.910
&gt;&gt;  IT IS.

00:06:01.941 --> 00:06:05.745
THEY ARE LOOKING INTO THAT RIGHT

00:06:04.043 --> 00:06:08.848
NOW WITH THOSE CALLS, BUT I CAN

00:06:05.879 --> 00:06:11.618
TELL YOU, IT'S NOT AN UNCOMMON

00:06:08.982 --> 00:06:14.387
THING WHERE WE SPEND TWO, THREE,

00:06:11.751 --> 00:06:15.555
FOUR, FIVE TIMES A WEEK THAT WE

00:06:14.520 --> 00:06:17.690
RESPOND TO THE SAME HOUSE FOR

00:06:15.688 --> 00:06:17.991
THE SAME PROBLEM OVER AND OVER

00:06:17.824 --> 00:06:20.493
AGAIN.

00:06:18.124 --> 00:06:20.793
&gt;&gt;  SO YOUR LIMITATIONS ARE

00:06:20.627 --> 00:06:23.229
WHAT?

00:06:20.927 --> 00:06:24.230
YOU COULD SIT DOWN WITH NIKOLAS

00:06:23.363 --> 00:06:26.766
CRUZ, CORRECT?

00:06:24.364 --> 00:06:27.100
I IMAGINE -- HE DIDN'T SEEM TOO

00:06:26.900 --> 00:06:29.969
BRIGHT.

00:06:27.233 --> 00:06:31.137
I IMAGINE YOU COULD SIT DOWN AND

00:06:30.103 --> 00:06:32.305
ASK HIM QUESTIONS.

00:06:31.271 --> 00:06:33.406
CAN I LOOK AROUND?

00:06:32.438 --> 00:06:35.008
DO YOU HAVE ANY GUNS?

00:06:33.539 --> 00:06:37.977
CAN I SEE WHERE THEY ARE?

00:06:35.141 --> 00:06:38.711
CAN I SEE WHERE THEY'RE STORED?

00:06:38.111 --> 00:06:39.479
DO YOU HAVE ANY IDEA IF THAT

00:06:38.845 --> 00:06:40.847
TOOK PLACE?

00:06:39.612 --> 00:06:42.115
&gt;&gt;  I DO NOT.

00:06:40.980 --> 00:06:42.482
&gt;&gt;  THAT'S A PRETTY IMPORTANT

00:06:42.248 --> 00:06:43.549
QUESTION.

00:06:42.615 --> 00:06:45.785
&gt;&gt;  I'M NOT PRIVILEGED TO

00:06:43.683 --> 00:06:47.053
COMMENT ON THAT BECAUSE IT'S AN

00:06:45.919 --> 00:06:49.088
ONGOING INVESTIGATION.

00:06:47.186 --> 00:06:51.658
I WOULD BE VIOLATING STATE

00:06:49.222 --> 00:06:55.128
STATUTE BY COMMENTING ON THAT.

00:06:51.791 --> 00:06:59.265
&gt;&gt;  THE NRA DEMONIZATION THAT'S

00:06:55.261 --> 00:07:01.334
GOING ON RIGHT NOW IS UNLIKE

00:06:59.399 --> 00:07:04.771
ANYTHING I'VE EVER SEEN.

00:07:01.467 --> 00:07:07.907
THEY'RE TRYING TO TAKE THEM OFF

00:07:04.904 --> 00:07:09.776
TV, KILL THEIR BUSINESSES.

00:07:08.041 --> 00:07:11.010
&gt;&gt;  I FIRMLY BELIEVE THIS IS NOT

00:07:09.909 --> 00:07:13.146
A GUN ISSUE.

00:07:11.144 --> 00:07:16.449
I'VE SAID THIS FROM DAY ONE AND

00:07:13.279 --> 00:07:16.716
HOLD THAT BELIEF UNTIL THE DAY I

00:07:16.582 --> 00:07:18.418
DIE.

00:07:16.849 --> 00:07:22.822
IT'S NOT THE GUN THAT'S THE

00:07:18.551 --> 00:07:23.356
PROBLEM.

00:07:22.956 --> 00:07:23.106
THE

00:07:23.106 --> 00:07:24.691
TH

00:07:23.489 --> 00:07:26.626
IT'S THE PERSON BEHIND THE GUN.

00:07:24.824 --> 00:07:28.962
I DON'T EVEN THINK THERE'S GOING

00:07:26.759 --> 00:07:30.430
TO BE AN OUTCOME THAT WILL FIX

00:07:29.095 --> 00:07:33.666
THIS PROBLEM, BECAUSE UNTIL WE

00:07:30.563 --> 00:07:34.767
CAN LINK THE MENTAL HEALTH

00:07:33.800 --> 00:07:36.169
RECORDS INTO THE CRIMINAL

00:07:34.901 --> 00:07:38.504
BACKGROUND CHECKS WE DO TO

00:07:36.302 --> 00:07:40.606
PURCHASE A FIREARM, WE WON'T SEE

00:07:38.638 --> 00:07:40.907
IF A PERSON HAS A MENTAL HEALTH

00:07:40.740 --> 00:07:45.311
ISSUE.

00:07:41.040 --> 00:07:46.746
THAT HAS TO BE RESOLVED WITH THE

00:07:45.445 --> 00:07:51.451
MEDICAL ASSOCIATION AND HIPAA

00:07:46.879 --> 00:07:50.833
LAW VILLAGES

00:07:50.833 --> 00:07:51.217
LAW VILLAGE

00:07:51.217 --> 00:07:51.250
LAW VIOLAGE

00:07:51.250 --> 00:07:51.284
LAW VIOLATE

00:07:51.284 --> 00:07:51.317
LAW VIOLATIO

00:07:51.317 --> 00:07:51.351
LAW VIOLATIONS

00:07:51.351 --> 00:07:55.221
LAW VIOLATIONS.

00:07:51.584 --> 00:07:57.623
&gt;&gt;  SHERIFF ISRAEL SAID, WE NEED

00:07:55.355 --> 00:07:59.525
LESS GUNS ON OUR STREETS, NOT

